description.narrative:
General question: Results related to the intended outcome 2014Question: Summarise results related to the intended outcome (this information will be sent to Open Aid)Answer: Since the beginning of the project, the increase in competence on the WTO related topics has been indicated by: 
-100% of respondents representing the Department of WTO Cooperation and Trade Remedies;
-98% of respondents representing relevant public authorities;
-93% of respondents representing business.
As of end-August 2014, Outcome 1, Outcome 3, Outcome 7, Output 1 and Output 2 of revised project RAF were completed. The TPPU project substantially progressed towards goals set for other outputs, including: 
-68 participations of representatives of 6 public authorities (100% of revised project target) were trained;
-570 business representatives (95% of revised project target) representing 17 sectors (113% of project target) were trained;
-66 publications (83% of project target) were produced.
